              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kobala EJAKAIT Satan ebe, “Kibuni kai?” Koboŋok Satan EJAKAIT ebe, “Abuni kaboŋobono keilat kakwap, kariariat lailo ka laije.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
