        },
        {
          "text": " Kobala EJAKAIT Satan ebe, “Iwomit ijo nuka ekakejaanakinan Yob? Naarai emamei loeputos kaŋes kakwap, etuŋanan lomam itoronitai, loeteni, loeyoŋit Edeke, esaeit da aronis: ido eroko itogogoŋit abeiteke, karaida kiimaimait eoŋ ebe keliko nes komam akirot.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
