        },
        {
          "text": " Kosodete kepuputu ipapero luuni luka Yob aronis na kere naadoikini ŋes, kopotu, konyounite niniruŋanan kaiboisike; Elipas Etemanit, ka Bilidad Esukit, ka Sopar Enaamatit: kitutukis adolokin amonyakin ka aitalakar ŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
